{"id":1120602,"chapter_id":1120602,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"你看，就一句话的事儿，我说过不会浪费你的时间的。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"莓丝一手抱着手里的大号小熊公仔，一手掏出钥匙打开了房门。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"就在刚刚，你和莓丝经过了楼下的公仔店。莓丝路过门口时说了一句“老规矩，新品全打包送楼上”。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"接着她随手拿走了柜台前的一个大号小熊公仔，头也不回地走向了电梯。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"嘿咻——开啦，进去吧。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"推开门，映入眼帘的是颇为可爱的墙纸与内饰。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"精致的茶具、沙发上的玩偶、壁炉旁贴着卡通贴纸的铁砧锤子……","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"与其说这里是锻造工坊，倒不如说更像一间少女的起居室。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"你先坐，我去找账本。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"可以让管理局的人帮你找。","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我东西太多了你们找不到的，还是坐着吧，翻乱了我更找不着。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"……哦我都忘了，你们已经翻过了。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哦对了，桌子上有茶叶，自己泡吧。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"莓丝开始在房间里东翻西找。一边的你没什么事可干，于是打量起屋子里的装饰。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"这些玩偶都是你的？","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"当然啦？数量确实有点多就是了……但都是我自己花钱买的啊。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我很有钱的，我的订单都排到明年了。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"你问这个干嘛？","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"没什么，只是觉得不太像你的风格。","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哈？！","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"一直背对着你翻找账本的莓丝回过了头。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"你什么意思？就因为我是个锻造师，是个禁闭者，就不配买这些可爱的小东西吗？","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"我不是这个意思……","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"你很喜欢它们？","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"你指着沙发上堆得满满的公仔玩偶问道。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"喜欢啊，喜欢得不得了。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"看到可爱的东西人的心情都会变好不是吗？","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"那锻造呢？你喜欢吗？","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"也很喜欢啊。这不矛盾吧。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"嗯，不矛盾，只是觉得有点……","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哈，我知道你想说什么。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"武器是用来伤害别人的，但这些玩偶人畜无害，不像是同一个人的爱好，对吧？","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"动手的又不是我，我只是负责把武器做出来。我只是享受这个锻造的过程。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"嘶，奇怪……也不在这里，我到底把账本放哪儿去了……","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"你看了看壁炉边上的小铁砧。那玩意儿被装饰得非常可爱，活像一台烤漆儿童钢琴。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"所以，你就是用这个锻造武器的？","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"怎么可能？那是工艺品啊工艺品，你幼稚不幼稚啊。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"锻造武器可是会有很多黑烟和脏东西的，在这么可爱的房间里做这些也太没常识了吧。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"那你的工坊在哪儿？","style":2,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"楼下。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"这里是我的卧室和会客厅，所有与锻造无关的东西我都放在这里。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"不对啊，这里也没有……","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"你看着一直在东翻西找的莓丝，思考着要不要给她一点建议。","style":3,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"options":["或许在楼下？"],"style":6,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602044,"trial_step":44,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"或许在楼下？","goto":45}]},{"step":45,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"嘶……应该……不在吧。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"坏了坏了，不会真丢那儿了吧……我下去看看。","style":1,"background":1047,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"你跟着莓丝去了楼下的工坊。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"这里与楼上完全不同，灰暗、脏乱，天花板上黑漆漆的，和传统印象中的锻造工坊如出一辙。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"你在这种写字楼里锻造武器，不会有人投诉吗？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"没事，我每年都会给物业缴一大笔保护费，他们投诉也没用……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"……让我来看看你究竟藏哪儿了小宝贝。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"莓丝费力地拖出几个沉重的箱子。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"打开箱盖，里面堆满了种类繁多的武器。各种类型都有囊括。但最多的还是长短不一但一看就令人不寒而栗的冷兵器。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"不知为何，这些武器让你本能地感到不适。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"这是……","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"样品。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我一般给客户做东西都会多做几份。给自己留个样，也好作为以后的参考。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"不对，这些绝不是普通的武器样品。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"刚刚打开箱盖的时候，那种令人汗毛倒竖的气息绝非你的幻觉。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哈！原来你在这儿！","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"账本？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"不是，只是我刚来新城那会儿的作品。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"莓丝从箱子里抽出一把长剑。剑柄和剑鞘似乎是纯银打造，上面还镶嵌着红色的珠宝，看上去华丽非凡。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"然而，与它华丽精美的外表不同，你看着它只觉得反胃。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哈哈，你看出来了啊。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"是个体面老头订的。看上去人模狗样的，付账的时候反而抠抠索索。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"他好像是打算用这个去解决他那个有钱老婆……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"你知道他的计划，为什么不报警？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"他又没亲口跟我说，我猜的。没证据就报警有什么用。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"那他动手了吗？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我哪知道，我后来又没再见过他……还有这两个！","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"莓丝又翻出两柄骇人的单手钉头锤。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"那两个富公子明明在楼上的时候要好得不得了，说是要锻两柄一样的武器一起去打什么全甲格斗。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"私底下却都来找我要加配重，想在“实战”里隔着盔甲下黑手。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"新城人，真虚伪。要是在辛迪加，这俩人根本不用藏着掖着。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"这是那个想搞他爸的，这是想报复前男友的，这个……唔这个不记得了，应该不重要……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"你……","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"别问，问就是猜的。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"或者换个说法，我看出来的。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"你能看穿他人的想法？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"没那么厉害。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我只能看穿他们的恶意。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"人呐，只要心怀恶意，迟早都会像提线木偶一样被它操纵，结局可不就注定了。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"你终于明白那些令你不适的气息是什么了。正如莓丝所说——那就是恶意。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"在莓丝的描述之下，面前的恶意愈发鲜活纯粹。你被它刺激得几乎要干呕出来。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"怎么样？是不是感觉内心的阴暗面被激发出来了？","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"接下来呢？该像个正常人一样做点带有恶意的举动了吧？","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"……喂，给点反应啊，我可是特意带你来看它们的。其他人想看都看不着呐。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"你不是带我来找账本的？！","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"别傻了，整个工坊就我一个人，谁需要账本啊。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我可是为每一件作品都做了备份诶，这样还不够吗？","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"你明明知道那些人的目的，为什么还要替他们锻造武器？！","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"原因吗……其实不止一个。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"首先当然是因为——我不在乎啦。他们要做什么关我什么事。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"而且绝大多数新城人都是胆小鬼，就算这么想，也不敢这么干的。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"其他原因呢？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"其他的说了你也不懂……不过告诉你也没关系就是啦。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我一直在对抗一种，非常非常非常恐怖的东西。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"是什么？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"像你这种麻瓜肯定不知道啦。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"它能控制人做他们原本不想做的事情。它是所有暴行的幕后黑手，是让人堕落的罪魁祸首。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"人类的恶意就是它伸进现实的触须。它能摧毁一切，但大家却连看都看不见它。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"刚开始我也拿它没办法啦，可后来我成了禁闭者，我发现说不定还有机会。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我可以把大家的恶意收集起来，用它自己的力量去伤害它，甚至是消灭它……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"这里的每一件作品都是我的一次尝试。可惜，迄今为止我还没锻造出能伤害到它的武器……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"不过没关系的，我还在打造一件最强的秘密武器。等到我完成之后，一定就可以干掉它了！","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"莓丝倾诉犹如精神病人毫无意义的呓语，你从中无法获取任何有效信息。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"她说了这里没有账本，但每一件作品都有备份。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"你刚刚说过，你给每一件作品都留了备份的，对吧？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"我需要找到那个毒气弹，立刻。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"好吧好吧，我就知道你没耐心听我说完，我找就是了。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"莓丝有些不情愿地在箱子里又翻找了起来。片刻之后，她取出了一个装着液体的透明罐子。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"喏，就是这个，拿去吧。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"告诉我这个人的情报。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"他呀，一般来说我是不会接毒气弹这种没品味的订单的。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"但他可太有意思了……虽然还比不上你，但在我遇到过的客户里，他也算得上是数一数二的混蛋。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"他……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"莓丝的声音戛然而止。她看着你，突然露出了一个极度令人不快的笑容。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我不想说了。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"content":"你必须告诉我。这不是请求，是命令。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"我不告诉你，你能把我怎么样？","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"content":"莓丝挑衅式的发言让你的耐心达到了极限。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"content":"新城还有成千上万的人正面临着威胁，不能再陪她耗下去了。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"options":["使用枷锁"],"style":6,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602125,"trial_step":125,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"使用枷锁","goto":126}]},{"step":126,"content":"告诉我，这个人的全部信息。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"啊！","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"咳咳咳咳……咳咳……哈哈哈哈……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈……看来你……哈哈哈也不是无懈可击的嘛……哈哈哈……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"这下……哈哈哈……有意思了……你也会被操控……哈哈……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"content":"莓丝挣扎着抵抗枷锁的力量，但还是很快败下阵来，上气不接下气地将情报和盘托出。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"杰克……那佩尔……新城治安局副局长的儿子……有名的二世祖……","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"很好，继续。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"莓丝的气息逐渐平复下来。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"他半年前找到我，想做一种“能搞出大乐子”的武器。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"content":"你看着手上的液体罐，继续问道——","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"这里面的液体是什么？为什么能让人发狂？有解药吗？","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"没有。这是我提取了他内心的恶意做的。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"只要取下保险，拉开引信就能用。几分钟后就会变得跟水一样毫无威胁。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"杰克很满意，那之后我就没再见过他。","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"content":"够了。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"content":"有这些情报就足够了，你打开了通讯器。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"content":"嫌疑人的真实身份是新城治安局副局长的儿子杰克·那佩尔，立刻寻找他的下落。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602143,"trial_step":143},{"step":144,"content":"……","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602144,"trial_step":144},{"step":145,"content":"……嗯，组织人手，我们马上过去。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602145,"trial_step":145},{"step":146,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"哦——他不会刚好就定在今晚袭击吧？","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602146,"trial_step":146},{"step":147,"content":"你猜得没错。又或许，你不是猜的。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602147,"trial_step":147},{"step":148,"content":"你转向莓丝，冷漠地下达了命令。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602148,"trial_step":148},{"step":149,"content":"你要和我一起去阻止他。","style":2,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602149,"trial_step":149},{"step":150,"speaker":"莓丝","content":"嘻嘻……我有拒绝的权力吗？","style":1,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602150,"trial_step":150},{"step":151,"content":"令人不快的笑容再一次爬上她的嘴角。","style":3,"background":2014,"log_type":1,"src_id":220602151,"trial_step":151}]}